    "heroes": "hero list scrolls without lag, filters operate",
    "story": "story chapter selectable, battle entrypoint reachable",
    "visual_battle": "visual battle starts and finishes (where wired)",
    "post_battle_report": "report screen shows MVP/seed/rewards preview",
    "material_raid_alpha": "alpha screen loads even with backend OFF, no crash; with flag ON, alpha-slice-config returns 200 and battle preview returns deterministic seed",
